  <ThingDef ParentName="PlantBase">
    <defName>RM_Vessark</defName>
    <label>vessark</label>
    <description>A muscular grey-green cable as thick as a leg, coiled around kollavane braids and around its own kind, bark scarred where it constricts. Never freestanding — it is always on something. The churn made legible: where vessark wins, a braid dies and a gap opens; where it loses, a path closes.</description>
    <statBases>
      <MaxHitPoints>70</MaxHitPoints>
      <Flammability>0.3</Flammability>
    </statBases>
    <graphicData>
