  <ThingDef ParentName="PlantBase">
    <defName>RM_Tavrosk</defName>
    <label>tavrosk</label>
    <description>A squat tree that is mostly trunk — a glossy, distended bole streaked with dried amber runs where old taps wept, under a mean little crown. It looks kept, like a barrel someone owns. Its sweet volatile sap is tapped as drink, trade good, and still-burner fuel.</description>
