    <label>dulloth</label>
    <description>Broad rigid leaves the size of doors, held flat and level, meeting neighbouring dulloth pane-to-pane with almost no gap. From below it is a ceiling; from above, a sealed floor of dark green. The canopy sealer — the reason the gloom is total. Cutting dulloth is how a clearing is made.</description>
