  <ThingDef ParentName="PlantBase">
    <defName>RM_Threllick</defName>
    <label>threllick</label>
    <description>A dense mat of interlaced surface roots, grey-brown and slick, running in visible strands between the thicket's trunks. It is the ground over most of the biome — you walk on it, and it is why walking is hard. The stolen river's first plumbing: every plant here is plumbed into it.</description>
