  <ThingDef ParentName="PlantBase">
    <defName>RM_Sellith</defName>
    <label>sellith</label>
    <description>A pale green weed that grows only along the silk irrigation gutters, rooted into the drip, hanging in neat fringes under the lines. Its shape is the web's shape — it never occurs except in runs. The gutter-weed: a sellith run overhead means a live gutter, means stolen water moving.</description>
