    <description>A low plant that is mostly trap: two ribbed, in-curved jaw-leaves held sprung and open, dull green outside, bone-pale within — the biome's palette in a mouth. A swallowed bulge shows in the stem of a fed one. The free tier's snap-trap; being held in this biome is the real danger. The snap-trigger/immobilize hazard mechanism is a follow-on build.</description>
