    <description>A leafless dark wand, chest high, ringed at intervals with collars of translucent needle-spikes that shiver when anything passes. Spent collars leave bare rings — a norrveth's history is written on its stem. Disturbed, it flings a collar of glassy needles; the needle-cast fragmentation hazard is a follow-on build.</description>
